/Title (Dynamic physical systems, from planetary atmospheres to plasma fusion reactors, are chaotic: a single deterministic forecast hides how sensitive they are to initial conditions. Machine learning now simulates distributions of plausible trajectories instead of one confident answer. This department judges such tools by validation sets and structural limits, not by marketing promises.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 494 0 R
/Next 603 0 R
>>
